{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は似顔絵会、そしてカレンダーお渡し会、\nすっごくすっごく楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりした!(о´∀`о)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ来てくれた皆さん本当にありがとう( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレンダーも似顔絵も大切にしてねー!＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!あとね、\n思ったよりも似顔絵が上手いことが発覚したよーヽ(｀･ω･´)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかに\nえ、ちょ!上手じゃん!\nって言われたもーーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(p`･ω･´q)よっしゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!\n昨日の乃木どこ見た?(>ω<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディー流れたね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイトでも期間限定で流れてるからチェックしてみてねー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いた感想待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、\n昨日はゆみこにとって最後の活動。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこにちゅーしようとしたらこんな顔された。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これこそ愛情ーーヾ(*･∀･*)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これみて分かる通りね、仲良しなんだよ(´>ω<｀)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじってるけどなんだかんだみんなゆみこのこと大好きで、\nみんなの話を聞いてあげて、慰めてあげて、見守ってくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな存在がいなくなっちゃうのがすごくさみしい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の頃、一番上のお姉さんだしかっこいい系だし一匹狼タイプだし\n仲良くなれるのかな、大丈夫なのかな、とか色々考えてて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうしたらゆみこが優しく話しかけてくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみことは同じ埼玉で帰りが一緒になることが多かったから\nそのときにいっぱい話して打ち解けていった気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこの考え方とかすごい大人で、すごいなーって感心したこといっぱいあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慰めてくれたこともいっぱいあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で愚痴を喋ったこともあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人でDSをしながらみんなの顔を作ったこともあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で帰るその帰り道が、すごく大好きでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も、実はあのあと一緒に帰ったんだー!♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後までゆみこ独占(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからのこととか、\nいままでのこととか、\nいっぱい話してくれたゆみこは、\nどこか寂しそうで、でもどこかスッキリした顔してて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいけど、ゆみこが頑張るって言ってるから応援したい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってゆみこが大好きなんだもん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しい寂しい寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き大好き大好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れ頑張れ頑張れ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔のゆみこが、大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよならじゃないよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねだよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おうちに遊びおいで!って言われたから容赦無く押しかけるよ!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで焼肉行こう!ゆみこのおごりで!笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの話聞いてあげる人必要だから聞いて慰めて守ってあげて!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/19/8142068/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}